{"id":"en_raised-my-bully-s-baby-reclaimed-everything","title":"Raised My Bully’s Baby, Reclaimed Everything","titleEn":"Raised My Bully’s Baby, Reclaimed Everything","description":"After being bullied in high school by Chloe, Emma—then overweight—was left with Chloe's baby and paid to vanish. She raised Noah as her own child and built a new life by the sea. Six years on, a chance encounter brings Chloe back into her life, now with a rich fiancé named Adrian. The couple begins prying into Noah's background, aiming to take him from Emma. But the facts emerge: Adrian is not Noah's father. In the end, Emma and her exceptionally gifted son leave the country, finally unburdened and looking ahead to a hopeful future.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/raised-my-bullys-baby-reclaimed-everything/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/raised-my-bullys-baby-reclaimed-everything/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Plot Twist","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cmfvy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_raised-my-bully-s-baby-reclaimed-everything_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cmfvy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_raised-my-bully-s-baby-reclaimed-everything_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cmfvy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_raised-my-bully-s-baby-reclaimed-everything_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cmfvy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_raised-my-bully